## Trap notes (this session's scars — repeat offenders)

- **esbuild bundles BUILT dist, not src**: edit src → `npx tsc -b` in the package → `pnpm run bundle` in packages/agentide → restart gateway. Stale dist cost hours.
- Kill gateways/apps by PID from `ss -ltnp` (pkill -f 'bin.bundled' doesn't match); app processes can linger after EADDRINUSE crashes — check :3000 before sims.
- App reads `.env` relative to ITS cwd — boot from example dir.
- Tokens expire 1h — /tmp/ag-mcp.token AND the app's .env token (bounce app after re-mint).
- `agentide` on PATH = PUBLISHED 0.9.3 (no fixes). Local bundle = `node agentide/packages/agentide/dist/bin.bundled.cjs`.
- `git push` may ask for credentials: `gh auth setup-git` + `GIT_ASKPASS=echo git push`.
- Audit contract: FileSystem.writeFile appends WITHOUT mode, WRITES with mode (secrets 0600) — never regress to plain writeFile.
- Full suite: 1 known env flake (consumer-ux 7300) when the gateway is up.

